+/*
+ * Once the log reaches the PC over USB, stop drawing kernel text on the
+ * panel (it still goes to the log ring; a panic draws again) and blank the
+ * old text, so the screen only shows the GUI. Without USB the text stays as
+ * the fallback. Boot-arg sweetquiet=0 keeps the text.
